; clauses
; example where the conclusion is a conjunction and proven in one step
load propositional
bool A, B, C, D
use A
use B
use A and B implies C
use A and B implies D
; inference of `C and D` actually requires more steps:
;     C         ; by impl-elim
;     D         ; by impl-elim
;     C and D   ; by and-intro (defined in "propositional.kurt")
; however, our implementation can do it in one step (to avoid excessive and-intro)
C and D
;;; Proof checked.
